[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WebKit/WebKit/pulls/65975","id":3766472015,"node_id":"PR_kwDOExyGPc7gf81P","html_url":"https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/pull/65975","diff_url":"https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/pull/65975.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/pull/65975.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WebKit/WebKit/issues/65975","number":65975,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[JSC] Array rematerialization should know how to have a bad time","user":{"login":"webkit-opensource-integration","id":283825532,"node_id":"U_kgDOEOrVfA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/283825532?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/webkit-opensource-integration","html_url":"https://github.com/webkit-opensource-integration","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/webkit-opensource-integration/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/webkit-opensource-integration/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/webkit-opensource-integration/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/webkit-opensource-integration/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/webkit-opensource-integration/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/webkit-opensource-integration/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/webkit-opensource-integration/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/webkit-opensource-integration/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/webkit-opensource-integration/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"#### eba64ef44de395091d66bdfdf1c2b1f0f4983c56\n<pre>\n[JSC] Array rematerialization should know how to have a bad time\n<a href=\"https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=311883\">https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=311883</a>\n<a href=\"https://rdar.apple.com/174420676\">rdar://174420676</a>\n\nReviewed by Keith Miller.\n\nSunk Arrays that are rematerialized with a butterfly are always rematerialized\nwith a contiguous butterfly. If, in the meantime, the VM had a bad time and\nmoved all Array structures to SlowPutArrayStorage, rematerialization can end up\ntreating remterialized Arrays, which are now ArrayStorage, as if they had\ncontiguous butterflies.\n\nThis PR fixes that by always rematerializing with the contiguous butterfly, but\nswitching to SlowPutArrayStorage after the fact if the VM is having a bad time.\n\nTest: JSTests/stress/ftl-osr-exit-phantom-new-array-with-butterfly-having-a-bad-time.js\n\n* JSTests/stress/ftl-osr-exit-phantom-new-array-with-butterfly-having-a-bad-time.js: Added.\n(cb):\n(collect):\n(opt):\n* Source/JavaScriptCore/ftl/FTLOperations.cpp:\n(JSC::FTL::JSC_DEFINE_NOEXCEPT_JIT_OPERATION):\n\nOriginally-landed-as: 305413.641@rapid/safari-7624.2.5.110-branch (899331a21899). <a href=\"https://rdar.apple.com/176058667\">rdar://176058667</a>\nCanonical link: <a href=\"https://commits.webkit.org/314202@main\">https://commits.webkit.org/314202@main</a>\n</pre>\n<!--EWS-Status-Bubble-Start-->\nhttps://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/commit/7653536f87539adf99fba4423a592a82952d3c83\n\n| Misc | iOS, visionOS, tvOS & watchOS  | macOS  | Linux |  Windows |\n| ----- | ---------------------- | ------- |  ----- |  --------- |\n| [✅ 🧪 style](https://ews-build.webkit.org/#/builders/38/builds/165368 \"Passed style check\") | [✅ 🛠 ios](https://ews-build.webkit.org/#/builders/159/builds/38858 \"Built successfully\") | [✅ 🛠 mac](https://ews-build.webkit.org/#/builders/168/builds/32439 \"Built successfully\") | [✅ 🛠 wpe](https://ews-build.webkit.org/#/builders/5/builds/174356 \"Built successfully\") | [✅ 🛠 win](https://ews-build.webkit.org/#/builders/59/builds/122569 \"Built successfully\") \n| | [✅ 🛠 ios-sim](https://ews-build.webkit.org/#/builders/155/builds/39140 \"Built successfully\") | [✅ 🛠 mac-AS-debug](https://ews-build.webkit.org/#/builders/156/builds/38807 \"Built